 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "A card is [suit, rank]; suits order CLUBS<DIAMONDS<HEARTS<SPADES, ranks A<2<...<10<J<Q<K. Shuffling is injected: the argument is the already shuffled 52-card deck. Cards are dealt one at a time round-robin from the top (card i goes to player i mod players). Deal as in variant 2, then play one round per card in a hand: each player plays their strongest remaining card (rank first, suit breaks ties); the strongest played card wins the round. Return the number of rounds won by each player.",
